Task #91: HTML vs plain-text rendering of the renewal invoice and payment-received emails, and link resolution
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Status:      in-progress
  Priority:    medium
  Class:       standard
  Assignee:    --
  Tags:        email, day-06
  Due:         2026-08-08
  Estimate:    1h30m
